lp  you guide and plan your business I would  start with what is it that really  excites you about your your business  what's the vision that you have your  company you know what's what gets your  blood pumping when you wake up in the  morning to pursue this this business  opportunity so create that vision  statement you know what what you're here  to do made your goal for the company  this is almost going to get you excited  every day and then from there start  working out how you're going to make it  happen so you know  what kind of marketing do you need to do  who are the people that you need to  bring on what kind of you know finances  do you need to have in place to make it  work and how you're going to phase that  out over a period of years if you're  doing a three-year plan or a five-year  plan just make sure it makes common  sense you have to come back to your  business plan on a regular basis to  update it to you know reflect the market  changes that you're seeing the business  plan never goes according to plan but  it's still like a process to go through  and to keep monitoring and updating so I  hope that helps two different bits of  advice depending on if you're going to  use it yourself or if you're going to  use it to go out and get funding but if  you have extra questions feel free to  leave it below for those watching if you  liked the video please give it a thumbs  up makes you want to create more of  these videos for you guys and if you  have a question of a business plan or if  you have some advice or for dicas well  feel free to leave it in the comments  underneath I always love seeing those  two and we'll see you on the next  episode  you
 

